<p>I've been waiting for this comment, and some legitimate critique.</p>
<p>Thank you, first off, for stating all of that. I honestly can't agree more &#8212; I realize thar isn't exactly realistic in accordance to what it should be. I won't pull the &quot;this is my first tale series&quot; card either; I've been a member long enough, and I really should understand the inner workings of the Foundationverse better.</p>
<p>That being said, although I cannot alter the course of this tale without creating complete disconnect, and expect downvotes from you for the rest of this series, I will take this into account on my next attempt. I've been buggered to do a tale series for a while, and this is the result. As those who talk to me about it&#8212; I'm not happy when people just tell me yes. Not entirely. It's nice to hear praise, but there is always something. And I think what you have just described has helped me better understand what I lack as an author here, in both my scant list of scips, and these tales insofar.</p>
<p>Thank you, Kalinin. This will definitely help me in the future.</p>

							</div>

								
					
